# Generated by `npm run problems:gen`, in a format chosen for review: long test
# arrays stay on one line. Prettier would put every element of a 5000-element
# case on its own line and turn a 300 KB catalogue back into megabytes.
problems/*/*/tests.json

# Generated by `npm run problems:schema` from the zod schemas, and never edited
# by hand (CLAUDE.md > Conventions). Prettier collapsing their arrays counts as
# editing them by hand: the emitter writes `JSON.stringify(..., 2)`, so every
# `npm run format` put the files back out of step with their own generator and
# `problems:schema --check` reported them stale for good.
docs/schema/*.schema.json
